      en: ["Vietnam's bauxite reserves are estimated at 5.4 to 11 billion tons.", "The Tan Rai alumina plant began commercial operations in 2013.", "Alumina is transported by truck and rail to the ports of Binh Thuan.", "About 90% of Vietnam's bauxite reserves are located in the Central Highlands.", "The Nhan Co project in Dak Nong produces about 650.000 tons of alumina annually.", "Bauxite in Vietnam is processed primarily into aluminum oxide for export."],
